  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br />If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is polynomial, <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is ratio of polynomials,&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Therefore, the possible values of <math><mi>a</mi></math> is <math><mn>2</mn></math>."
